  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is point on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></math>, such that tangent at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;pass through centre of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>65</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now tangent at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>and it pass through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So, point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now product of all possible value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p><p>And&nbsp;product of all possible value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>65</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
